# Files that do not go into the WordPress.org SVN release.
# The Vue/SCSS source (src/), build script (build/) and package.json stay in the release
# so reviewers and users can read and rebuild the source of the compiled assets.
.git
.gitignore
.distignore
node_modules
svn
# Development tooling (tests run against a local test site, see tests/README.md)
vendor
tests
composer.json
composer.lock
phpunit.integration.xml
build/.lock
.gstack
